uns 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, January to February and June to July each came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those years. In 2025, August to September came in at 35% of normal on the middle of the grids, and in 2026 so far, January to February came in at 36%. Grid 24480 had its driest year in 1963 at 65% of normal.</p>"}
